Description: Clipboard translator powered by any OpenAI-compatible LLM
 Press Ctrl+C twice to translate the clipboard into the configured target
 language. Streams responses, translates interactively, runs on KDE Plasma
 and any other desktop (X11 and Wayland via XWayland).
